// Button looks and changeFill streams (section 5.1)
// Author: not credited on the listing page
// Source: VPRI TR-2012-001 (STEPS 2012 final report), Appendix I (KScript and KSWorld), section 5.1 Buttons, lead-in 'the following code ... appearance', PDF page 28 (printed page 27)
// Transcribed from the page images; text-layer differences noted below.

highlightEnabled <- streamOf(true)
looks <- this.defaultLooks() fby
           when mergeE(entered, pressed, selected)
           then ...

changeFill <- when looks :f then
    if f.fill
        this.fill(f.fill)
    if f.borderFill
        this.borderFill(f.borderFill)

// Transcription notes
// - Text layer vs image: no glyph differences found in this listing.
// - Spacing: indentation and alignment come from glyph positions, checked against the page image.
// - The blank line between the looks block and changeFill is printed, so it is kept.
// - Uncertain glyphs: none.
